# RMGaaS Development Rules

# ⚠️ CRITICAL: Read /ARCHITECTURE.md before any work

## Product Model
- Writer = Core Product (works without AI)
- Scribe = AI Layer (optional accelerator)
- Test: "If AI is down, can users work?" → Must be YES

## AI Principles
- AI is PRIMARY for onboarding & workflow creation
- AI is OPTIONAL for daily operations
- AI outputs → Traditional UI → User reviews → Submit
- AI CANNOT: approve, bypass permissions, act without confirmation

## Current Gaps (Priority Order)
1. Request Flow UI (backend ready, no frontend)
2. Workflow Builder (visual canvas needed)
3. Permission System (frontend missing)
4. Real-time Notifications (mock data only)
5. Real AI Integration (currently simulated)

## Tech Stack
- Backend: Express + TypeScript + Prisma + PostgreSQL
- Frontend: React + Vite + TanStack Query + Zustand + shadcn/ui
- AI: Not yet implemented (all "AI" is pattern matching)

## Key Files
- /ARCHITECTURE.md - Source of truth
- /ALIGNMENT_TRACKER.md - Progress tracker
- /docs/ - Detailed specifications

## Before Coding
1. Read ARCHITECTURE.md
2. Check ALIGNMENT_TRACKER.md
3. Ensure change aligns with Writer+Scribe model
4. Update tracker after milestones
